        <mxCell id="final" parent="1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;⑨ AP: reply 수신·decode → 호출자에게 반환&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#52657A&quot; style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;AP-side MHU IRQ socket은 현재 미연결. RSE SFCP는 실제 firmware 서비스이며 full profile에서 C++ PSA stub가 응답하지 않는다.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Noto Sans CJK KR;fontSize=18;spacing=12;fontColor=#172C43;strokeColor=#235D86;" vertex="1">
